WEBVTT

1
00:00:12.401 --> 00:00:13.862
was covered in glowing chemicals.

2
00:00:13.882 --> 00:00:17.424
"I have to wash these chemicals off!"

3
00:00:17.644 --> 00:00:18.285
thought Roxy.

4
00:00:18.305 --> 00:00:22.047
"They're making me itchy—and angry!"

5
00:00:23.227 --> 00:00:25.568
She remembered the fire trucks back at the train crash.

6
00:00:26.509 --> 00:00:29.931
"The firefighters can spray me with the hose," thought Roxy.

7
00:00:30.911 --> 00:00:32.920
Stomp, stomp, stomp!

8
00:00:32.940 --> 00:00:36.022
"Wah-hu! Wah-hu!"

9
00:00:36.862 --> 00:00:39.123
Blue Baboon was still walking toward Metro City.

10
00:00:40.283 --> 00:00:41.504
"I need to move fast!"

11
00:00:41.744 --> 00:00:42.744
Roxy said to herself.

12
00:00:44.905 --> 00:00:47.546
She flew through the air, but the chemicals got in her eyes.

13
00:00:49.667 --> 00:00:51.508
She almost crashed into some power lines.

14
00:00:53.389 --> 00:00:55.189
Then she almost plowed into a train car.

15
00:00:56.050 --> 00:00:57.830
Finally she landed near Detective Smith.

16
00:00:57.850 --> 00:01:00.752
"Help!" Roxy cried.

17
00:01:01.804 --> 00:01:03.085
"These chemicals are awful!

18
00:01:03.665 --> 00:01:05.487
They're really, really itchy!"

19
00:01:05.507 --> 00:01:07.268
"Oh no!"

20
00:01:07.589 --> 00:01:08.329
said the detective.

21
00:01:08.349 --> 00:01:09.730
"How can I help?"

22
00:01:09.750 --> 00:01:13.814
"Tell the firefighters to blast me with the hose!"

23
00:01:14.094 --> 00:01:14.734
said Roxy.

24
00:01:14.754 --> 00:01:17.376
"Right!" said the detective.

25
00:01:23.341 --> 00:01:26.584
The firefighters aimed the hose at Roxy, and water gushed out.

26
00:01:28.145 --> 00:01:30.086
A moment later all the chemicals were gone.

27
00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:32.800
"Whew!" Roxy sighed.

28
00:01:32.820 --> 00:01:34.521
"That's better."

29
00:01:36.222 --> 00:01:37.502
Then she realized something.

30
00:01:37.522 --> 00:01:41.384
"I know why Blue Baboon is so angry!

31
00:01:42.244 --> 00:01:44.525
He's itchy from all the chemicals!"

32
00:01:46.386 --> 00:01:47.867
Roxy picked up the fire truck.

33
00:01:47.887 --> 00:01:52.449
"I need to borrow this," she told the firefighters.

34
00:01:54.069 --> 00:01:55.410
She flew after Blue Baboon.

35
00:01:58.171 --> 00:01:59.672
By now he had reached the city.

36
00:02:02.604 --> 00:02:02.944
"Wah-hu! Wah-hu!"

37
00:02:02.964 --> 00:02:04.105
People ran and screamed.

38
00:02:04.125 --> 00:02:07.147
"It's a big baboon!"

39
00:02:08.888 --> 00:02:10.289
"Run for your lives!"

40
00:02:11.570 --> 00:02:13.632
"Save us, Rocket Girl!"

41
00:02:15.293 --> 00:02:19.276
Splash! Roxy dumped the fire truck's water on Blue Baboon.

42
00:02:20.497 --> 00:02:21.758
All the chemicals washed off.

43
00:02:24.900 --> 00:02:26.341
Blue Baboon stopped glowing.

44
00:02:27.382 --> 00:02:28.342
He stopped stomping.

45
00:02:29.163 --> 00:02:30.224
And he stopped scratching.

46
00:02:31.136 --> 00:02:33.518
The big baboon sat down and closed his eyes.

47
00:02:34.639 --> 00:02:35.800
He looked much happier.

48
00:02:35.820 --> 00:02:39.223
"Yay!" Roxy cried.

49
00:02:39.243 --> 00:02:42.225
"Blue Baboon isn't angry anymore.

50
00:02:43.686 --> 00:02:45.147
But he's still a giant.

51
00:02:46.188 --> 00:02:48.470
There's no way he can go on the tour now.

52
00:02:49.331 --> 00:02:51.472
And he can't return to the zoo either.

53
00:02:51.493 --> 00:02:54.735
Hmm Roxy tapped her chin and thought.

54
00:02:57.317 --> 00:03:00.460
A month later Roxy and her friends were watching TV at Jack's house.

55
00:03:01.832 --> 00:03:02.472
Mara grinned.

56
00:03:02.492 --> 00:03:06.533
"I was sad when we found out Blue Baboon wasn't returning to the zoo.

57
00:03:07.534 --> 00:03:09.394
But I'm not sad anymore."

58
00:03:09.414 --> 00:03:11.975
"Me neither," said Jack.

59
00:03:12.595 --> 00:03:13.755
"This is much better!"

60
00:03:13.775 --> 00:03:18.037
"The movie is starting," said Terrell.

61
00:03:19.337 --> 00:03:23.698
A movie title appeared on the screen: Blue Baboon Saves the World!

62
00:03:29.360 --> 00:03:29.880
said Jack.

63
00:03:30.900 --> 00:03:33.703
"I'm glad Rocket Girl brought Blue Baboon to Hollywood.

64
00:03:34.484 --> 00:03:35.965
Now he's a famous movie star!"

65
00:03:35.985 --> 00:03:40.209
"Rocket Girl sure is amazing," said Roxy.

66
00:03:41.030 --> 00:03:42.631
Terrell gave her a suspicious look.

67
00:03:43.292 --> 00:03:46.856
Roxy just smiled, and then reached into the bowl for more popcorn.
